# data/cache/*.pkl is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# Those files are real API responses captured at a known date, and they are what
# lets the project start in a fraction of a second with no credentials and no
# network — for anyone reading the repository, and for the deployed app on every
# cold start. They contain public market data and no secrets.
#
# To refresh them: delete the directory's *.pkl files and run the app once with
# a CoinGecko key present.

